on_status","html":"source-statement-checked; equality and variable-domain qualification repaired; full proof not independently reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\\in X_\\Sigma\">\\(\\chi\\in X_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是不含等号原子的闭句。选择与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\chi\">\\(\\neg\\chi\\)</span> 等价的闭前束句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，指定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ce2c2e33d033a7de\" href=\"?note=ce2c2e33d033a7de\" title=\"72-df-skolemization\">72-df-skolemization</a> 的新符号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec f\">\\(\\vec f\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi)=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\theta\">\\(\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi)=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\theta\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma&#39;\">\\(\\Sigma&#39;\\)</span> 是扩充后的五分量签名；若没有闭项，再添一个新常量，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HU}_{\\Sigma&#39;}\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{HU}_{\\Sigma&#39;}\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Valid}\">\\(\\operatorname{Valid}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropUnsat}\">\\(\\operatorname{PropUnsat}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HU}\">\\(\\operatorname{HU}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c0c477fb00da36dd\" href=\"?note=c0c477fb00da36dd\" title=\"72-df-herbrand-expansion\">72-df-herbrand-expansion</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Valid}(\\chi)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in(\\operatorname{HU}_{\\Sigma&#39;}^n)^m\\ \\operatorname{PropUnsat}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}\\theta[\\vec t_i/\\vec x]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Valid}(\\chi)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in(\\operatorname{HU}_{\\Sigma&#39;}^n)^m\\ \\operatorname{PropUnsat}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}\\theta[\\vec t_i/\\vec x]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由¬χ的Skolem形无模型与有限闭实例的命题不可满足性得到。旧式n没有绑定且忽略逻辑等号；现在矩阵变量个数明确为n，并与源书无等号tautology分支一致。源书带等号版本须使用等号公理的有限实例而非裸PropUnsat。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-skolemization","status":"resolved","id":"ce2c2e33d033a7de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-skolemization]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-herbrand-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"c0c477fb00da36dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-herbrand-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-skolemization","status":"resolved","id":"ce2c2e33d033a7de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\chi\\in X_\\Sigma$ 是不含等号原子的闭句。选择与 $\\neg\\chi$ 等价的闭前束句 $\\varphi$，指定 [[72-df-skolemization]] 的新符号族 $\\vec f$；$\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi)=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\theta$。$\\Sigma'$ 是扩充后的五分量签名；若没有闭项，再添一个新常量，故 $\\operatorname{HU}_{\\Sigma'}\\ne\\varnothing$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Valid}$ 与 $\\operatorname{PropUnsat}$ 见 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]，$\\operatorname{HU}$ 见 [[72-df-herbrand-expansion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-herbrand-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"c0c477fb00da36dd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Valid}$ 与 $\\operatorname{PropUnsat}$ 见 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]，$\\operatorname{HU}$ 见 [[72-df-herbrand-expansion]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\chi\\in X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi)=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HU}_{\\Sigma'}\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Valid}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PropUnsat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HU}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Valid}(\\chi)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists\\vec t\\in(\\operatorname{HU}_{\\Sigma'}^n)^m\\ \\operatorname{PropUnsat}\\!\\left(\\bigwedge_{i<m}\\theta[\\vec t_i/\\vec x]\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1805,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-herbrand|thm-herbrand — Herbrand's Theorem]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-herbrand — Herbrand's Theorem](72-thm-herbrand.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-herbrand|thm-herbrand — Herbrand's Theor